 coordination and information management."},{"type":"h","text":"🏠 Residential Design Management"},{"type":"p","text":"High-end residential and large housing developments."},{"type":"h","text":"🏙 Mixed-Use Development"},{"type":"flow","items":["Architecture","interiors","retail","public spaces."],"sep":"+"},{"type":"h","text":"Career Progression"},{"type":"h","text":"Design Management Route"},{"type":"flow","items":["B.Arch","Architect / Interior Architect","Design Coordinator","Senior Design Coordinator","Design Manager","Senior Design Manager","Associate / Design Director","Head of Design"]},{"type":"h","text":"BIM → Design Management Route"},{"type":"flow","items":["B.Arch","BIM / Architectural Intern","BIM Coordinator","Senior BIM Coordinator","Design Manager","BIM / Design Management Lead","Digital Design Director"]},{"type":"h","text":"Project Delivery Route"},{"type":"flow","items":["B.Arch","Architect / Interior Architect","Project Coordinator","Design Coordinator","Project Manager","Senior Project Manager","Program Manager","Development / Project Director"]},{"type":"h","text":"Emerging Technologies"},{"type":"h","text":"1. AI-Assisted Design Coordination"},{"type":"p","text":"AI can increasingly support:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Design-option comparison"},{"text":"Drawing review"},{"text":"Specification analysis"},{"text":"Design change detection"},{"text":"Clash prioritization"},{"text":"Documentation checks"},{"text":"Meeting/action tracking"},{"text":"The Design Manager will increasingly become an information and decision-management professional."}]},{"type":"h","text":"2. BIM + AI"},{"type":"p","text":"Future workflows may connect:"},{"type":"flow","items":["BIM Model","AI Analysis","Clashes","Cost","Schedule","Performance","Design Alternatives"]},{"type":"h","text":"3. Digital Twins"},{"type":"p","text":"After construction, BIM can evolve into an operational digital asset."},{"type":"p","text":"Applications include:"},{"type":"list","items":[